    {
      "etag": "\"d2114af6a9bf6fdce2732ce45a28f44b\"",
      "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/annotations/1f5fbe63-fe48-40df-b065-ff5b2fcf2dc4/",
      "type": "Annotation",
      "created": "2026-04-19T15:53:09.128141+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-04-19T15:54:37.659259+00:00",
      "dc:source": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/sources/1230/",
      "target": {
        "source": {
          "id": "https://figgy.princeton.edu/concern/scanned_resources/62003b47-3f84-4c93-bb04-1f43175dfdeb/manifest/canvas/8cd4bd30-6456-4c64-bdb2-ccb2598a7c47",
          "type": "Canvas",
          "partOf": {
            "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/10045/iiif/manifest/"
          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:352.79168701171875,1339.2672119140625,3272.4551391601562,2366.9178466796875",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, main text",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>This is the petition of the worthless slave, who is but a speck of dust, to the noble dust under the feet of my esteemed lord. I, the lowly one, am poor and have many dependents.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Mah\u0323mu\u0304d Keth\u032eu\u0308da\u0304 sent a Jewish s\u0323arra\u0304f named \u02bfIna\u0304yet as an accountant for the estate of Ibn Baghda\u0304d,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>[but] two and a half months after he arrived here in Cairo, he died, and I, the lowly one,</p>\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n<p>became the accountant for the money from Ibn Baghda\u0304d\u2019s textiles sold in Kha\u0304n al-Khali\u0304li\u0304. Now that Mahmu\u0304d Keth\u032eu\u0308da\u0304 has [also] died, </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>they detain me, saying, \u2018You are the Jew\u2019s partner\u2019, and demand that I pay what was owed, [even though] I am innocent [of any debt].</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It is requested of my illustrious lord that you impose the shari\u0304\u02bfa so that I, the lowly one, am not oppressed. </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In my lord\u2019s days of justice, no one can be oppressed. The\u00a0eternal command is my illustrious lord\u2019s. [Signed] //the poor, lowly one// Mu\u0304sa\u0304</p>\n</li></ol>\n\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    }
